  "plain": "Whitley Strieber, a writer known for describing his own encounters with strange beings, says that in London in 1968 he went to see 2001: A Space Odyssey, Stanley Kubrick's film based on a story called The Sentinel, and ended up sitting right beside its co-writer, Arthur C. Clarke. He tells it as a memorable chance meeting from his early life."
